WEBVTT

00:24:57.079 --> 00:25:00.996
publish a story like I would never, ever,
ever be talking to you right now.

00:25:01.163 --> 00:25:05.704
Yeah. And it reminds me of that little
mantra you had while you were

00:25:05.704 --> 00:25:09.538
on your hike. I'm not afraid. I'm not
afraid. I will not be afraid.

00:25:09.579 --> 00:25:14.288
Yeah, well, and of course. And of course,
when did I say I'm not afraid?

00:25:14.496 --> 00:25:17.496
And I was. Yeah. And, you know,
even to this day, like,

00:25:17.496 --> 00:25:20.871
writing is so hard for me.
It's so hard for me.

00:25:21.038 --> 00:25:23.788
I still have to say, Cheryl,
you can do this.

00:25:23.788 --> 00:25:26.413
You're going to do this and you
are not going to give up.

00:25:26.413 --> 00:25:28.538
You're not going to be second.

00:25:28.538 --> 00:25:33.246
You're going to go you're going to, you
know, go all the way to the finish line.